0">414</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.82</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.23</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">7200</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">293</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.25</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">143</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.16</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.44</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.55</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote3"><label/><p>Parameters are <italic>C</italic><sub>max</sub> (maximum concentration), AUC (area under the concentration <italic>vs</italic> time curve), Cl (Clearance), <italic>t</italic><sub>1&#x0002f;2</sub> (half-life), <italic>V</italic><sub>d</sub> (volume ofz distribution based on the elimination phase).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Plasma pharmacokinetics of NU7026 and NU7107 following administration at 20&#x02009;mg&#x02009;kg<sup>&#x02212;1</sup> i.p. to mice</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Compound</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold><italic>C</italic><sub>max</sub> (nmol&#x02009;l<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold><italic>T</italic><sub>max</sub> (h)</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>AUC last (nmol&#x02009;l&#x02009;h<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)</bold><